OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fat first, quickly clearing up to leave
OL,7,Fgenerally dry conditions with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Blustery showers developing
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon, heavy at times.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe blustery showers
OL,12,Fcontinuing through the evening, though
OL,13,Fsome cloud breaks may develop in the
OL,14,Feast. Widely windy with strong gusts,
OL,15,Fespecially on the coast.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA chilly start with showers
OL,18,Fexpected through the day, but also
OL,19,Fsome sunny intervals. Showers mostly
OL,20,Fclearing by evening. Very windy, with
OL,21,Fcoastal gales possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
